                <Title>Laari-TTS-Dataset</Title>
                <Description>The dataset contains audio and text resources on Laari, a Bantu language spoken in the Congo. The resources, which are suitable for TTS tasks and possibly ASR tasks, consist of the following: 
- 6,311 audio clips totalling 241 minutes and 44.97 seconds;
- an audio mapping file with 5,321 lines, each beginning with the name of an audio file, followed by a tab and then the corresponding text excerpt;
- two raw audio files totalling 120 minutes and 54.90 seconds;
- two long audio files with their original, non-split transcription files, for a total duration of 120 minutes and 41.90 seconds.</Description>
